    """Determine if a VersionRange is empty, meaning no versions satisfy it. range_string: A string representation of a version range, e.g., '>=1.0,<2.0' -> True. prereleases: Whether pre-releases are allowed. If False, ranges containing only pre-releases are considered empty."""
